----
LIMIT must be a non-negative integer

# F-099: show_clauses.rs::filter_suffix_plain_values_and_limit_unchanged — LIKE with a `%` pattern plus LIMIT 10 / LIMIT 1, and a listing with no clauses at all
query TTTTTT nosort
SHOW SEMANTIC VIEWS LIKE 'dcf_cust%' LIMIT 10;
